            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ukończony adres URL zawiera teraz oba filtry kursu.</p><p>Przekaż <code>url</code> do <code>requests.get()</code>, aby wysłać połączone żądanie.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>requests</code>, następnie <code>.</code>, a potem <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ukończony adres URL zawiera teraz oba filtry kursu.</p><p>Pobierz kursy pasujące do obu filtrów, a następnie przetwórz odpowiedź jako JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>requests</code>, następnie <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>, <code>response</code> i na końcu <code>json</code>.</p></body></html>",
